 455:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** ********************************************************************************
 456:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** *
 457:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** * Summary:
 458:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** *  Sets the Relution of the SAR.
 459:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** *  This function does not affect the actual conversion with PSoC5 ES1 silicon.
 460:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** *
 461:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** * Parameters:
 462:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** *  resolution:
 463:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** *  12 ->    RES12
 464:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** *  10 ->    RES10
 465:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** *  8  ->    RES8
 466:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** *
 467:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** * Return:
 468:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** *  None.
 469:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** *
 470:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** * Side Effects:
 471:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** *  The ADC_SAR_Seq resolution cannot be changed during a conversion cycle. The
 472:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** *  recommended best practice is to stop conversions with
 473:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** *  ADC_SAR_Seq_1_StopConvert(), change the resolution, then restart the
 474:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** *  conversions with ADC_SAR_Seq_1_StartConvert().
 475:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** *  If you decide not to stop conversions before calling this API, you
 476:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** *  should use ADC_SAR_Seq_1_IsEndConversion() to wait until conversion is 
 477:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** *  complete  before changing the resolution.
 478:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** *  If you call ADC_SetResolution() during a conversion, the resolution will
 479:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** *  not be changed until the current conversion is complete. Data will not be
 480:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** *  available in the new resolution for another 6 + "New Resolution(in bits)"
 481:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** *  clock cycles.
 482:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** *  You may need add a delay of this number of clock cycles after
 483:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** *  ADC_SAR_Seq_1_SetResolution() is called before data is valid again.
 484:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** *  Affects ADC_SAR_Seq_1_CountsTo_Volts(), ADC_SAR_Seq_1_CountsTo_mVolts(), 
 485:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** *  and ADC_SAR_Seq_1_CountsTo_uVolts() by calculating the correct conversion 
 486:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** *  between ADC counts and the applied input voltage. Calculation depends on 
 487:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** *  resolution, input range, and voltage reference.
 488:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** *
ARM GAS  C:\Users\elias\AppData\Local\Temp\ccdGwYAd.s 			page 91


 489:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** *******************************************************************************/
 490:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** void ADC_SAR_Seq_1_SetResolution(uint8 resolution)
 491:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1.c **** {
